    "title": "Otra jornada de la Gran Feria Mankel en Plaza Huincul",
    "excerpt": "Por Analía Montenegro | josenizzo.info Este domingo 17 se llevó a cabo otra edición de la Gran Feria Mankel en el CPEM N°85 de Plaza Huincul, junto a artesanos, productores y feriantes. Esta feria que...",
    "content": "<figure><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/josenizzo.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Analia_photo_JN.jpeg?ssl=1\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/josenizzo.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Analia_photo_JN.jpeg?resize=688%2C840&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure><p>Por Analía Montenegro | josenizzo.info</p><p>Este domingo 17 se llevó a cabo otra edición de la Gran Feria Mankel en el CPEM N°85 de Plaza Huincul, junto a artesanos, productores y feriantes.</p><figure><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/josenizzo.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/WhatsApp-Image-2025-08-17-at-19.22.25.jpeg?ssl=1\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/josenizzo.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/WhatsApp-Image-2025-08-17-at-19.22.25.jpeg?resize=696%2C522&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure><figure><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/josenizzo.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/WhatsApp-Image-2025-08-17-at-19.22.26-2.jpeg?ssl=1\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/josenizzo.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/WhatsApp-Image-2025-08-17-at-19.22.26-2.jpeg?resize=696%2C522&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure><figure><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/josenizzo.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/WhatsApp-Image-2025-08-17-at-19.22.26.jpeg?ssl=1\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/josenizzo.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/WhatsApp-Image-2025-08-17-at-19.22.26.jpeg?resize=696%2C522&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure><p>Esta feria que recorre la ciudad invita a los interesados en participar a comunicarse con sus organizadores al 299 5 223854.</p><figure><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/josenizzo.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/JN.info_Logo_solo-300x168-1.webp?ssl=1\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/josenizzo.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/JN.info_Logo_solo-300x168-1.webp?resize=299%2C168&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure>",
