    "author": "José Nizzo",
    "date": "2025-07-01T11:08:42",
    "image": "https://josenizzo.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Neuquen-ola-polar-frio-temperaturas-bajo-0-foto-mati-subat-6.webp",
